        "title": "差不多 + predicate or quantity",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "差不多 marks approximation to a value or a completion threshold, not exact equality. A task is almost done in 我差不多把这些书都看完了; this does not tell us which subset of books is completely finished.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我差不多把这些书都看完了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chàbuduō bǎ zhèxiē shū dōu kàn wán le 。",
                "meaning": "I have almost finished reading all these books.",
                "audio": "049ea6973de64aeb93ca95262190a9c5a9a58affe7f5a975e1a8dd06f86e9439"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书和那本书差不多大。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū hé nà běn shū chàbuduō dà 。",
                "meaning": "This book and that book are approximately the same size.",
                "audio": "49589094b8ed5130db50731f55c65472c777aba4a11acc6c4211a7f7b9d2c34c"
              }
            ]
